eep_w\", 6.0)),\r"},{"line":1633,"text":"                             generations=int(job.get(\"repair_generations\", 6)), pop=int(job.get(\"repair_pop\", 8)))\r"},{"line":1634,"text":"        if rr_ is None:\r"},{"line":1635,"text":"            return None\r"},{"line":1636,"text":"        return {\"press\": rr_[\"after\"][\"press_cm2\"] + rr_[\"after\"][\"hand_press_cm2\"],\r"},{"line":1637,"text":"                \"arm_bad\": [] if rr_[\"after\"][\"arm_excess_deg\"] <= 0 else [\"arm %.0f deg past its limits\" % rr_[\"after\"][\"arm_excess_deg\"]],\r"},{"line":1638,"text":"                \"moved_cm\": rr_[\"moved_cm\"]}\r"},{"line":1639,"text":"    # only a real fault: a press past its allowance, or an arm rule broken (a grip rule a hand on its way breaks\r"},{"line":1640,"text":"    # is the motion's, not the repair's)\r"},{"line":1641,"text":"    if L.hand_presses(side, None, GLOVE, other=True, soft=SOFT)[0] <= 0.0 and not L._arm_report(side, L._limits()[0])[1]:\r"},{"line":1642,"text":"        return None\r"},{"line":1643,"text":"    return L.repair_hand(side, glove_cm=GLOVE, other=True, soft=SOFT, keep_w=float(job.get(\"repair_keep_w\", 6.0)),\r"},{"line":1644,"text":"                         span_cm=float(job.get(\"repair_span_cm\", 10.0)), generations=int(job.get(\"repair_generations\", 6)),\r"},{"line":1645,"text":"                         pop=int(job.get(\"repair_pop\", 8)))\r"}],"name":"repair","start_line":1626,"symbol_id":"hold-code/weaponlab/gunkit/blender/gunkit_hands.py#func:repair"}}
